1.3            C.I.P  and  S.I.P. of manufacturing and Holding  Tanks.
1)CIP of Mfg.Tank to be done on the sameday after completion of bulk filtration
2)SIP of Mfg.Tank to be done at 121øC for 30 minutes using Steam of PSG.
3)CIP of Holding Tank along with product line to be done by first cleaning the 
  Tank & then take about 150 L of hot distilled water from storage tank for CIP
4) SIP of Holding Tank to be done at 121øC for 30 minutes using steam of PSG.
